<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Antivirals Inc prices at $9.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Antivirals Inc prices at $9.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     Antivirals Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $9</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		$8 - $10</p>
<p>   Number of Units			 2,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Paulson Investment Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of units for the planned initial public offering in Antivirals Inc was raised to 2.0 million units from 1.5 million units previously.</p>
</text>
